{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You don't know who put you in hell, but that won't stop you from killing the demons, stealing their goods, and finding a home out in the charred fields.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Scissors in Hell</strong></i><strong> is a chaotic Dungeon Crawler.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore:</strong> Strange hellscapes... in real-time (no grid!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight:</strong> Demons, puny or strong, but always weird... in turn-based combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect:</strong> Your foes' loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft:</strong> an arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<strong>Build:</strong> a cool base, if you want to <i>only</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find:</strong> and Conquer all the Hellworld's Dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You may find yourself:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-setting an octopus that rides a unicycle on fire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-blowing up said octopus by throwing oil on it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-planting a paper tree and watching it grow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-enraging bat people who cosplay as the pope</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-crafting a cool weapon from brimstone (or plastic!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-using tubs to make paper (or plastic!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-building a fort out of cardboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-studying dire origami magic from rare books</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-casting down the partially palindromic scourge the Demon Nom(inat)ed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-learning how this hell was made and why you are here</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspired, in equal parts, by:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-old school western RPGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >